  "period_note": "HALF-YEARLY filing (occupies the Q2 slot per project convention; no discrete-Q2-only statement is published). Balance sheet is the 30-Jun-2023 period-end snapshot (reported), Solo basis. Income statement items are CUMULATIVE from 1 January 2023 (H1=6 months). Sourced via fresh OCR (pdftoppm 300dpi + tesseract) rather than raw pdftotext, for the same reliability reasons as 2023_Q1. Comparative (31-Dec-2022) column matches this dataset's existing 2022_Q4.json exactly for total_assets (314,841.323539m), total_equity (18,379.798831m), paid_up_capital (9,807.42478m), statutory_reserve (7,131.286231m), total_deposits (226,059.482332m), gross_loans (225,709.286939m) and off_balance_sheet_exposures (61,901.836582m). Balance-sheet identity holds exactly for the current period (291,533.997023 + 18,678.02098 = 310,212.018003). statutory_reserve is corroborated by the bank's 20%-of-PBT rule: prior year-end (7,131.286231m) + 20% of cumulative H1 profit-before-tax (521.053665m x 20% = 104.210733m) = 7,235.496964m, matching the reported figure exactly. Income statement fully reconciles: operating_profit = total_operating_income - total_operating_expenses (4,555.897182-3,354.672179=1,201.225003 exact); profit_before_tax = operating_profit - total_provision (1,201.225003-680.171338=521.053665 exact); profit_after_tax = profit_before_tax - tax_expense (521.053665-28.520773=492.532892, matches 492.532891 reported). Tax split: the current/deferred breakdown printed in this document's own H1-2023 column is ambiguously column-aligned (a 'Current tax expense 4,084,863' entry that does not reconcile with the confirmed subtotal); the CURRENT/DEFERRED split used here (current 30.0m, deferred a small net credit of -1.479227m) instead uses the value independently reported for this same H1-2023 period as a comparative column in the later onebankplc-half-yearly-2024.txt filing, which reconciles exactly against the subtotal (28.520773m) confirmed independently in BOTH documents. Paid-up capital (9,807.42478m) is unchanged from 31-Dec-2022 and 31-Mar-2023; the bonus issue to 10,297.79601m happened between 30-Jun-2023 and 30-Sep-2023.",
